## Progress Tracking

Track progress in `initiatives/<initiative>/<project>/progress.yaml`.

Missing information never blocks a phase. Defer the document or exit criterion, record it in `open_items` (what's missing, owner, revisit phase) and keep going. Before Launch, the PM resolves each open item or accepts it as a risk. Publishing approval and code-shipping release gates remain hard stops.

## Session Handover

Before ending a session, create `HANDOVER.md`:

```
Read .claude/skills/session-handover.md and create a handover
```

For long-running work, maintain `STATUS.md` per `.claude/skills/session-handover.md`.

## Code Shipping Requirements

When shipping code (not PM-only artifacts):
- Intent vs. implementation audit required
- Independent review required (genuinely separate reviewer)
- Test evidence required
- Owner explicit GO required (silence is never go)
- If tools unavailable: mark Not Verified and **block release**

See `.claude/skills/release-gate.md` and `.claude/skills/independent-review.md`.

## Quality Standards

Every artifact must meet checklists in:
- Agent files (`.claude/agents/*.md`)
- Skill files (`.claude/skills/*.md`)
- Template files (`templates/*.md`)
